TreeGraph source package

Lean/Lake: 4.29.0. Main import/file: TreeGraph / TreeGraph.lean.
Principal facade: TreeGraph/FinalTheorem.lean.
The required Core2 and Core3tree libraries are included locally.
Build from this directory with the supplied dependency lock:
  lake build TreeGraph

Scope of the final API (namespace TreeGraph.RawPrimitive):
  tree_imbalance_delta_final_closed evaluates DeltaTreeModel for rooted trees
  with PositiveWeights and natural n with [NeZero n].
  tree_imbalance_raw_final_closed and tree_imbalance_signed_final_closed also
  require an explicit CompleteFormalization certificate. Do not omit it when
  describing the general raw-assignment result.
  tree_imbalance_raw_expanded_edge_sum_verifiedShape_closed instead requires
  VerifiedShape; the constructors in TreeGraph/VerifiedShapes.lean cover a
  positive leaf, edge, or three-vertex star.

See ../THEOREM_MAP.txt for exact declarations and the distinction between the
recursive model formula and raw-source correspondence. This package's general
raw theorems must not be described as unconditional arbitrary-tree proofs.

Prerequisites, pinned dependency setup, and checksum commands: ../BUILDING.txt.
No compilation was performed for this packaging revision; see ../VERIFICATION.txt.
Licensing status: ../REUSE_NOTICE.txt.
Lean sources are unchanged. Required source count: 154 files, 105,384 physical
lines (including blank lines and comments). Build products and work reports
are excluded.
